/Title (He was not a difficult man, not in the way people usually mean. He paid his rent. He ate his meals. He observed the social niceties that keep strangers from becoming enemies. He held doors open. He stepped aside on staircases. He gave way on narrow pavements)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 908 0 R
/Prev 1373 0 R
/Next 1038 0 R
>>
endobj
1206 0 obj
<<
