/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1039 0 R
/Next 1374 0 R
>>
endobj
1207 0 obj
<<
/Title (Behind him, the fountain caught the first light and held it for a moment , the gray stone suddenly golden, the cracks illuminated, the raised arms casting long shadows across the empty basin. Then the light shifted and it was gray again. And it was still a fountain.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1375 0 R
/Next 1040 0 R
>>
endobj
1208 0 obj
<<
